        "original_id": "0444a17a-9cd7-5c01-a6e8-5295f6a4b8b4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kevin DuBrow, Lance King\n- Organizations: Quiet Riot, Nightmare Records\n- Roles: heavy metal singer, vocalist, record label founder\n- Topics: melodic rock, progressive metal, power metal\n\nFacts:\n- Kevin DuBrow was born on October 29, 1955, and died on November 19, 2007.\n- Kevin DuBrow was an American heavy metal singer best known as the lead vocalist of Quiet Riot from 1975 to 1987 and again from 1990 until his death in 2007.\n- Lance King was born on November 23, 1962, and is an American heavy metal vocalist specializing in melodic rock, progressive metal, and power metal.\n- Lance King founded Nightmare Records in 1990 to release his own music and still leads the label.\n- Lance King has sung with many groups over the last 35 years.",
